"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"TCM-Integrated Proctology Surgery\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-900 via-teal-900 to-emerald-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><p class=\"text-lg text-emerald-200 mb-4 tracking-wider\">Anorectal Care Programme</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">中西医结合肛肠科手术</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-emerald-200 mb-4\">中西医结合微创治疗</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">顾氏外科传承 · 中西医结合 · 微创治疗 · 标本兼治</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">80% Crohn's肛瘘愈合率</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">15%复发率（远低于国际平均）</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">个性化方案</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">双语全程陪诊</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-colors\">邮件咨询</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">优势项目 → 了解详情 →</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-emerald-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-2\">80%</div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">克罗恩病肛瘘愈合率</p></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-2\">15%</div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">复发率（远低于国际平均）</p></div><div class=\"text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-2\">30-40%</div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">愈合时间缩短</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">顾氏外科传承 · 百年肛肠专科</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">传承百年\"顾氏外科\"学术积淀，将传统中医精髓与现代先进技术无缝融合，为复杂性肛瘘、混合痔等肛肠疾病患者提供精准、个性化的治疗方案。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">标准西方手术治疗复杂性或克罗恩病相关肛瘘存在显著的括约肌损伤风险和高复发率。我们采用挂线疗法、药线疗法结合国际先进的VAAFT视频辅助肛瘘治疗技术和FiLaC激光闭合技术，在临床括约肌保护率和复发率降低方面获得公认疗效。</p><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><p class=\"text-emerald-700 font-medium\">院内制剂——金黄膏、红油膏、生肌散等——进一步加速创面愈合，减少瘢痕形成。</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"TCM Proctology Treatment\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">两大肛肠疑难病症</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">我们专注治疗的两种复杂肛肠疾病</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">复杂性肛瘘/克罗恩病相关肛瘘</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">肛瘘是肛管与周围皮肤之间的异常通道，通常由肛周脓肿引起。复杂性肛瘘具有多分支瘘管，穿过或靠近括约肌。克罗恩病相关肛瘘极易复发，被国际公认为最难治疗的肛肠疾病之一。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">混合痔（环状）</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">痔疮是肛管内血管垫异常增大。混合痔同时涉及内痔和外痔成分。慢性或长期出血可能导致贫血。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">五大不可替代的临床优势</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">保括约肌·功能优先</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">传统瘘管切开术存在部分括约肌损伤和失禁风险。挂线疗法和药线疗法通过分阶段切割和局部给药实现瘘管逐渐闭合——最大程度保留术后括约肌控制和排便功能。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">院内制剂·加速愈合</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">院内制剂——金黄膏（消肿）、白玉膏（组织再生）、红油膏（清创愈合）及口服促愈颗粒——形成完整的术后创面护理体系。临床数据显示愈合时间缩短30-40%，瘢痕形成显著减少。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">国际微创技术</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">熟练掌握VAAFT视频辅助肛瘘治疗、直肠推进瓣和FiLaC激光闭合技术——为不适合传统手术的患者扩展治疗选择。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-stethoscope \"><path d=\"M4.8 2.3A.3.3 0 1 0 5 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v5a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1a.2.2 0 1 0 .3.3\"></path><path d=\"M8 15v1a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6v-4\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">中医整体调理·长期防复发</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">除局部治疗外，个性化中医调理——补气中药方剂、饮食指导和排便习惯改善建议——解决复发的根本原因，而非仅治疗当前发作。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-8\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-3\">微创·快速恢复（痔疮）</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">对于混合痔，结合硬化剂注射、套扎和微创手术——与传统Milligan-Morgan痔切除术相比显著减轻术后疼痛。患者通常可在24-48小时内恢复日常活动。</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8\">适用人群</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">复杂性或复发性肛瘘，包括克罗恩病相关肛瘘或多次手术后复发</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">混合痔（包括环状）寻求减轻术后疼痛和更快恢复</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">肛周脓肿手术后需要先进创面管理</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">寻求中西医结合护理以降低长期复发风险的患者</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">在海外治疗效果不佳，寻求第二诊疗意见的患者</p></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8\">禁忌症</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-6\">请在咨询时向医生如实告知以下情况——适用性需个体化评估</p><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle text-rose-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">凝血功能障碍或正在服用抗凝药物</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle text-rose-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">炎症性肠病（克罗恩病/溃疡性结肠炎）活动期</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle text-rose-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">严重局部感染或活动性败血症</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle text-rose-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">孕妇（某些手术推迟至产后）</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-alert-circle text-rose-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><p class=\"text-gray-300\">影响伤口愈合的糖尿病控制不佳</p></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-700\">所有患者将在治疗前由专科医生评估，确认适用性并制定个体化方案。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">一站式全程陪诊服务</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">从在线咨询到返程随访，MedKungfu为每一位海外患者提供全程管家式服务</p></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">在线咨询与症状评估</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1-3 days</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">通过电子邮件联系MedKungfu——简要描述您的症状和病史即可开始。既往病历、手术史或影像资料（MRI、CT）有帮助但非必需。MedKungfu将安排肛肠科医生的初步远程评估。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">行程规划</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">3-7 days</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">确认治疗意向后，MedKungfu协助办理签证文件（包括医院邀请函）、医院附近住宿、机场接送安排，并根据计划的手术和住院要求推荐停留时间。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">入院前专家评估</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Day 1</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">抵达后，双语陪同人员陪同您前往医院。专家进行全面评估：中医体质分析；局部病变检查（包括肛瘘镜和影像复查）；个性化治疗方案制定和手术排期。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">手术与治疗</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Procedure day</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">根据病情：复杂性肛瘘采用挂线/药线疗法或VAAFT/FiLaC；痔疮采用结扎、硬化剂注射或微创手术。MedKungfu全程提供院内翻译。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">5</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">术后创面护理与随访</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Throughout stay</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">医生使用院内制剂进行标准化换药，定期评估创面愈合进展，并根据需要调整挂线张力或配方。MedKungfu协调所有随访就诊的交通和陪同。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-6\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0\">6</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] text-lg\">离院总结与居家护理指导</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-emerald-600 bg-emerald-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Before departure</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600\">完成主要治疗阶段后，医生提供双语书面总结：居家创面护理说明；饮食指导；复发预警信号和管理；长期随访计划。患者回国后，MedKungfu继续协调远程随访。</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-emerald-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">超越医疗的全程支持</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">双语翻译</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">每次就诊都有专属陪同和完整医疗翻译。所有记录、报告和治疗计划均提供双语格式，实现零障碍沟通。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">交通与陪同</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">机场接送和每次就诊的专属陪同——无需独自在医院奔波。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users \"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">专属协调员</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">个人协调员管理所有预约、进度跟踪、护理安排和住院期间的非医疗需求。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">签证与旅行支持</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">支持医疗签证邀请函、抵达指导和患者及陪同家属的住宿安排。</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">参考治疗费用</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">透明定价，全球价格优势无与伦比</p></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-white text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4\">约$7,000（含中医康复）</div><p class=\"text-emerald-100 text-lg mb-6\">具体费用以医院最终评估为准。</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-sm\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full\">✓ 含手术费用</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full\">✓ 含中医康复</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full\">✓ 含住院护理</span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-emerald-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">开启您的肛肠治疗之旅</h2><p class=\"text-emerald-200 mb-4\">联系我们进行免费初步评估</p><p class=\"text-emerald-300 mb-8\">医学顾问团队将在一小时内回复，并为您安排专业双语咨询服务</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a href=\"mailto:contact@medkungfu.com\" class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white text-emerald-900 font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-50 transition-colors\">邮件咨询</a><a class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">在线留言</a></div></div></div></section></main>"